.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt KILL 1
.Os Project9
.Sh NAME
.Nm kill
.Nd send a signal to a process
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl s Ar signal
.Op Fl -
.Ar pid ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
sends TERM unless another signal is requested.
The signal may be a number or a name such as
.Cm TERM ,
.Cm STOP
or
.Cm CONT .
For negative numbers and zero, see
.Xr send_signal 2 .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr send_signal 2 ,
.Xr waitpid 2
